<devicesets>
<deviceset name="615006144121" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:16446090/6" locally_modified="yes" prefix="J">
<description>WR-MJ Cat 3 Modular Jacks – THT

Characteristics

Shieldingless and shielded with EMI-spring option
Optional LEDs in various sequences
Angled, vertical and horizontal orientation
Stacked and assembled configurations
Properties

Properties

PoE++ compatible up to 100 W (IEEE 802.3bt)
UL and cULus certified
UL94-V0 insulator material
Ethernet Category 3 – Category 5 under conditions

Applications

Networks
