<deviceset name="615108137621R" prefix="J">
<description>WR-MJ Cat 3 Modular Jacks – THR

Characteristics

Shieldingless and shielded with EMI-spring option
Optional LEDs in various sequences
Vertical and horizontal orientation
Stacked and assembled configurations
Tape &amp; Reel packaging for pick-and-place assembly (Tray for larger stacks)

Properties

PoE++ compatible up to 100 W (IEEE 802.3bt)
UL and cULus certified
UL94-V0 reflow-compatible insulator material
Ethernet Category 3 – Category 5 under conditions

Applications

Networks
Internet of Things
Smart buildings

Created by Ella 2026-06-26
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
